{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/2a33af3ce7f8c2d7cf7d56117d741346.avif?t=1770360943\" width=606 height=64 /></span>The \u201cAncestors\u201d manuscript was stolen, terrible ancient magic broke out. The curse struck the inhabitants of Zagrobiya, turning them into obedient puppets in the hands of a mysterious master. The once prosperous lands fell into darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with Bony Bones, you have to save Zagrobiya, going from a simple resident to a brave hero, get to the cause of all disasters and destroy evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/b62745aa1e983d220af978eeb6bd0742.avif?t=1770360943\" width=606 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is a classic 3D platformer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 unique locations in Zagrobiya, each with its own atmosphere and biome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve riddles, get through deadly traps and find secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the people of Zagrobiya you meet during your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/1dc0a5886a1b3676e2e35f3ceaeba56d.poster.avif?t=1770360943\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/1dc0a5886a1b3676e2e35f3ceaeba56d.webm?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/1dc0a5886a1b3676e2e35f3ceaeba56d.mp4?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the enemies and bosses you meet on your way are unique, find an approach to each one.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/13077720f93d5a57c056de3684519a61.poster.avif?t=1770360943\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/13077720f93d5a57c056de3684519a61.webm?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/13077720f93d5a57c056de3684519a61.mp4?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and become stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop enemies in close combat with an axe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/00510b086bb158744a04d567e1cbc915.poster.avif?t=1770360943\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/00510b086bb158744a04d567e1cbc915.webm?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/00510b086bb158744a04d567e1cbc915.mp4?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ranged combat, destroy enemies with throwing bones, but remember that they are not endless.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/316dadc5c6b40ef8d365638c3f21d866.poster.avif?t=1770360943\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/316dadc5c6b40ef8d365638c3f21d866.webm?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/316dadc5c6b40ef8d365638c3f21d866.mp4?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to take calcium if Bony Bones' bones are cracking from opponents' blows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/1f4e85acaf2382471554cd847a04359f.poster.avif?t=1770360943\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/1f4e85acaf2382471554cd847a04359f.webm?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/1f4e85acaf2382471554cd847a04359f.mp4?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love fantasy, you like to explore new fairy-tale worlds and you are ready to help the inhabitants of Zagrobiya, then Bony Bones is waiting for you to go on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/7da4f22cb38d08fa47497cacd4c5f27a.avif?t=1770360943\" width=606 height=64 /></span>The game was created by one person, without the help of neural networks, who believes that creating games is an art. Bony Bones Adventures is an attempt to create an action platformer with a cozy atmosphere, colorful characters and atmospheric locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/87a87ed66061fad6a05c5beedf3f6414.webp?t=1770360943\" width=606 height=38 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2559520?t=1770360943","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770360943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770360943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770360943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/2a33af3ce7f8c2d7cf7d56117d741346.avif?t=1770360943\" width=606 height=64 /></span>The \u201cAncestors\u201d manuscript was stolen, terrible ancient magic broke out. The curse struck the inhabitants of Zagrobiya, turning them into obedient puppets in the hands of a mysterious master. The once prosperous lands fell into darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with Bony Bones, you have to save Zagrobiya, going from a simple resident to a brave hero, get to the cause of all disasters and destroy evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/b62745aa1e983d220af978eeb6bd0742.avif?t=1770360943\" width=606 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is a classic 3D platformer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 unique locations in Zagrobiya, each with its own atmosphere and biome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve riddles, get through deadly traps and find secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the people of Zagrobiya you meet during your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/1dc0a5886a1b3676e2e35f3ceaeba56d.poster.avif?t=1770360943\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/1dc0a5886a1b3676e2e35f3ceaeba56d.webm?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/1dc0a5886a1b3676e2e35f3ceaeba56d.mp4?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the enemies and bosses you meet on your way are unique, find an approach to each one.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/13077720f93d5a57c056de3684519a61.poster.avif?t=1770360943\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/13077720f93d5a57c056de3684519a61.webm?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/13077720f93d5a57c056de3684519a61.mp4?t=1770360943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and become stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop enemies in close combat with an axe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/00510b086bb158744a04d567e1