ove fantasy, you like to explore new fairy-tale worlds and you are ready to help the inhabitants of Zagrobiya, then Bony Bones is waiting for you to go on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/7da4f22cb38d08fa47497cacd4c5f27a.avif?t=1770360943\" width=606 height=64 /></span>The game was created by one person, without the help of neural networks, who believes that creating games is an art. Bony Bones Adventures is an attempt to create an action platformer with a cozy atmosphere, colorful characters and atmospheric locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/extras/87a87ed66061fad6a05c5beedf3f6414.webp?t=1770360943\" width=606 height=38 /></span></p>","developers":["KMH Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/header.jpg?t=1770360943","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 KMH Productions 2023. Bony Bones Adventures, KMH and their respective logos are trademarks of KMH Productions.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2559520/700976/96a6d6cd258ba35ff4bcdbe71ce6a92c6485801b/1750931352/dash_av1.mpd?t=1733127246","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2559520/700976/96a6d6